  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Studie av resultatutvecklingssamarbete med Guatemala 2021-2024</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Study of Results Development Cooperation with Guatemala 2021-2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med denna studie &#xe4;r att konsolidera/kvalitetss&#xe4;kra de resultat som uppn&#xe5;tts genom Sveriges samarbetsstrategi med Guatemala sedan 2021, med en framtidsanalys i relation till den svenska regeringens reformagenda.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this study is to consolidate/quality-assure the results achieved through Sweden&apos;s cooperation strategy with Guatemala since 2021, with a future analysis in relation to the Swedish government&apos;s reform agenda.</narrative>
